   :text "RESULT: watch-wake-wakes-on-judgment-bus-messages sha=<sha12> tier: frontier REPO: mas-bandwidth/nova-sprint BASE: v1.3/comms STOP: nova-sprint watch --wake wakes the coordinator on a kind=judgment bus message and on a machine message sent under the coordinator's own name by the sprint server or the heartbeat server, within one bus read, not only through the store at most once per --judgment-every; messages the coord Source: Glenn 13:57Z 2026-10-15: \"Event driven push notifications are vastly superior to polling. What else is like this? A poll where it should be a push notification to you, across nova tools and nova sprint?\"; the push audit of that hour (nova-tools abd4a6d, nova-sprint 3e51974), item 2 (its follow-up). Work audited 2026-10-15. No pushed head. "
