  (item "sprint-pins-nova-tools-with-staging-needs" :group "export-v13-blockers" :area "nova-sprint"
   :title "sprint-pins-nova-tools-with-staging-needs"
   :text "RESULT: sprint-pins-nova-tools-with-staging-needs sha=<sha12> tier: frontier REPO: mas-bandwidth/nova-sprint BASE: v1.3/comms STOP: go.mod pins a nova-tools commit that holds the landed staging-needs refusal, and a functional test drives the real staging path end to end: a packet the store built for a spike whose need landed is refused by the nova-tools member against a base without the need's head and staged once th Source: Glenn 13:18Z: \"card all 14 check and lint proposals plus the 4 loosenings as blockers, top-ranked first\"; the sprint-21 failure review (epoch 21, nova-sprint log and card histories). Split 2026-10-15 from the single staging-needs card: production stages through nova-tools pkg/member, so the refusal reaches the fleet only when nova-sprint pins it. Work audited 2026-10-15. No pushed head. "
   :why "Scoped out of the sprint by Glenn 2026-10-15: only the four tiny fixes stay in v13-blockers, tool-review-2026-10-15 and nova-local; the rest waits on the roadmap."
   :date "2026-10-15"
