  (item "release-drill-under-five-minutes" :group "export-v13-blockers" :area "nova-sprint"
   :title "release-drill-under-five-minutes"
   :text "RESULT: release-drill-under-five-minutes sha=<sha12> tier: frontier REPO: mas-bandwidth/nova-sprint BASE: v1.3/comms KIND: acceptance PRIORITY: blocker STREAM: v13-blockers WHO: friend STOP: one real release drill has run from the last landing on the stable line to 100% fleet adoption through the new pipeline, every step's time recorded by `nova-sprint release drill` in docs/RELEASE-DRILLS.md, and DONE-WHEN holds; or Source: The owner, 2026-10-15: no more than 5 minutes from the last landing to a release adopted across the fleet, ideally 1 minute to deploy across the fleet; today it takes 30 to 45 minutes. The fifth card of the fast release pipeline: a real drill from landing to fleet adoption, timings recorded; done at 5 minutes or less end to end and 60 seconds or less for the deploy step. Work audited 2026-10-15. No pushed head. "
   :why "Scoped out of the sprint by Glenn 2026-10-15: only the four tiny fixes stay in v13-blockers, tool-review-2026-10-15 and nova-local; the rest waits on the roadmap."
