   :title "v15-friendrows-text-lists-drop-word-tables"
   :text "RESULT: v15-friendrows-text-lists-drop-word-tables sha=<sha12> tier: pro DEPENDS-ON: v15-sprint-wires-bump-to-the-text-list-pin REPO: mas-bandwidth/nova-sprint BASE: sprint/v15-schema-tables KIND: feature PRIORITY: normal STREAM: v15-schema-tables STOP: when DONE-WHEN holds and the commit is on your branch, or a baseline refusal other than the element-kind change is met (HOLD), or the deadline is reached. Title: friendrows: running, live and facts are plain []string; RunWord, LiveWord and FactWord go. Source: nova-sprint PR #476 \"Schema improvements wanted\" item 1. schemas/friendrows/friendrows.schema wraps a text list's elements in three one-field tables: RunWord (lines 170-178), LiveWord (211-219) and FactWord (221-227). internal/sprint/store/presence.go mirrors them with `rowWord`, `rowWords` and `row. Column review, attempt 4, tier pro. Work audited 2026-10-18. Pushed heads: 9e2e33c8293141baa4aa52f02fa07ce997b999ad (hulk; on origin: sprint/v15-friendrows-text-lists-drop-word-tables.w1.g3.e21); 35505c10e0c28bc6b125f46b8a9c682ac6278163 (studio; on origin: sprint/v15-friendrows-text-lists-drop-word-tables.w2.g1.e21); d1dcb0c3cc0395e326799f2f94ba6e80ee1162d1 (hetzner1; on origin: sprint/v15-friendrows-text-lists-drop-word-tables.w3.g1.e21); 681290774dbea6cc2e2b386ff556f705b52bd0c4 (hetzner2; on origin: sprint/v15-friendrows-text-lists-drop-word-tables.w4.g1.e21)."
