   :text "RESULT: a13-cairn-entry-dual-read sha=<sha12> tier: pro DEPENDS-ON: none REPO: mas-bandwidth/nova-tools BASE: sprint/v15-schema-tables KIND: feature PRIORITY: normal STREAM: v15-schema-tables STOP: the entry table and its dual read are committed with DONE-WHEN holding, or the deadline is reached Title: Aspect 13: the cairn entry file read in both forms, refused by name when malformed, counted per form. Source: the coordinator, 2026-10-17: a13-cairn-entry-writer failed three times on one blocker: the cairn entry file appendEntry writes (entries/<session>/<id>.json, struct entryFile, internal/cairn/cairn.go ~176) has no table in schemas/ledger and no dual reader; readEntry (~891) and existingAppend (~861) a. Column ready, attempt 1, tier pro. Work audited 2026-10-18. No pushed head recorded."
   :why "Glenn 2026-10-17: \"Move the remaining v1.5 work to v1.7 roadmap.\""
