   :text "RESULT: l1-bus-envelope-retire-legacy sha=<sha12> tier: pro DEPENDS-ON: l1-bus-envelope-dual-read-2,l1-nova-bus-reader-builder-and-show-2,l1-nova-bus-native-binary-form-2,l1-writers-switch-2 REPO: mas-bandwidth/nova-tools BASE: sprint/v15-schema-tables KIND: feature PRIORITY: normal STREAM: v15-schema-tables STOP: the legacy reader is gone with DONE-WHEN holding, or the counter is not yet zero (then not-done), or the deadline is reached Title: Aspect 1: retire the legacy reader of the bus envelope. Source: the v1.5 gap audit (the owner, Glenn, 2026-10-17: \"v1.5 is complete adoption of schema end-to-end in tools and sprint\"); nova-sprint docs/research/schema-tables/UNION.md (read) section 6 (C13, the per-form counter); nova-tools schemas/README.md (read), the home rule and the pin.. Column working, attempt 3, tier flash. Work audited 2026-10-18. Pushed heads: 332dc4710c5ce9ded615f6e9479e8f8a32058175 (hetzner1; on origin: sprint/l1-bus-envelope-retire-legacy.w1.g2.e21); ad499de81b679323d9dcca4804bf0d95a316fc78 (amd-2; on origin: sprint/l1-bus-envelope-retire-legacy.w2.g2.e21). Working branch, not on origin: sprint/l1-bus-envelope-retire-legacy.w3.g2.e21 (hulk, working when moved)."
   :why "Glenn 2026-10-17: \"Move the remaining v1.5 work to v1.7 roadmap.\""
